	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader1c_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>デント『ポッド　きいてる？▼
もっと　べんきょうして
はやく　いちにんまえの▽
ジムリーダーに　ならないと……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:10:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:10:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>デント『ポッド　きいてる？▼
もっと　勉強して
はやく　一人前の▽
ジムリーダーに　ならないと……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:53:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:01:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:01:27" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER1C
デント</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:01:01" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader1a_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポッド『それだけどさ▼
いちねんまえ　おれたちが
Ｎのしろに　いってれば▼
しちけんじん　とか
ダークトリニティ　とかに▽
にげられなくて　すんだんだろ！▼
そうすりゃ　みんなから
３人　そろって……　とか▽
いわれて　いない　はずだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:54:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T04:49:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポッド『それだけどさ▼
１年前　おれたちが
Ｎの城に　行ってれば▼
七賢人　とか
ダークトリニティ　とかに▽
逃げられなくて　すんだんだろ！▼
そうすりゃ　みんなから
３人　そろって……　とか▽
いわれて　いない　はずだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:54:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T04:49:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:01:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER1A
ポッド</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T04:49:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
