				Time="2011-09-04T06:01:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER1A
ポッド</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T04:53:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
