	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader1a_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポッド『３ｖｓ３か！▼
さきに　たおした　やつが
おれらの　なかで▽
いちばん　つよいって　ことだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:58:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T04:54:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポッド『３ｖｓ３か！▼
先に　倒した　ヤツが
おれらの　中で▽
一番　強いって　ことだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T06:58:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T04:52:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・
・デントは一歩遅れる</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
